{"description":"Imata Studio arrives in Toronto.\nIn collaboration with Toronto Designers Market.\nJoin us for an intimate in-person launch of our retail collaboration with TDM.\nImata is contemporary fashion house celebrating femininity, colour and self-expression through thoughtfully designed, small-batch pieces.\nDiscover selected pieces from archive pieces to the latest Imata collections, explore the craftsmanship and details behind the designs, and experience the world of Imata Studio in person for the first time in Toronto.\nCome shop, discover and experience Imata.","organizer":"Imata Studio"}